## APPENDIX A: STUDY TIPS (نصائح المذاكرة)

### Key Areas to Review - AI Analytics (مناطق رئيسية للمراجعة - تحليلات الذكاء الاصطناعي)

- [ ] Confidence score interpretation table (90-100%, 75-89%, 60-74%, 40-59%, <40%)
- [ ] Seasonality coefficients for Algerian market (especially Ramadan impact)
- [ ] Six dimensions of supplier matching with exact weights
- [ ] Churn risk levels (Critical/Elevated/Moderate/Low/Minimal) and intervention times
- [ ] Pricing strategy selection criteria (when to use each of 4 strategies)
- [ ] Model performance metrics definitions (Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-Score)
- [ ] Retraining schedule by model type
- [ ] Drift detection meaning and response

### Key Areas to Review - Compliance (مناطق رئيسية للمراجعة - الامتثال)

- [ ] TVA rates (19%/9%/0%) with concrete examples of each category
- [ ] Legal references: 75-59 (Commerce), 76-147 (TVA), 03-01 (Trade), 18-07 (Data)
- [ ] Compliance score ranges and corresponding processing actions
- [ ] Sanctions match levels (Exact/High/Medium/Low) and required responses
- [ ] Document validity periods (RC: 30 days, others vary)
- [ ] Response SLAs by severity (P1: <1hr, P2: <4hr, P3: <24hr, P4: <48hr)
- [ ] Data subject rights under Loi 18-07 (Access, Rectify, Forget, Object, Portability)
- [ ] When to escalate and to whom

### Common Mistakes to Avoid (أخطاء شائجة يجب تجنبها)

| Mistake | Why Wrong | Correct Understanding |
|---------|-----------|----------------------|
| Confusing Precision and Recall | Different formulas | Precision = quality of positive predictions; Recall = ability to find all actual positives |
| Mixing up TVA rates | Most products are 19% | Only specific basic necessities get 9%; exports get 0% |
| Wrong escalation timing | Timing matters | Critical = <1 hour; Major = <4 hours; Moderate = <24 hours |
| Document expiry confusion | Varies by type | RC max 30 days; Fiscal attestation per printed date; IDs per validity |
| Sanctions over-reaction | Not all matches = block | Low/Medium require review first; only Exact = auto-block |
| Assuming auto-approval | Human in loop required | ALL AI suggestions require human validation |
| Ignoring confidence scores | Scores matter | <75% requires additional due diligence before decisions |
| Ramadan uniform impact | Pattern varies | Day vs Night differs; pre-Aid spike varies by product category |

