## APPENDIX B: FORMULA REFERENCE CARD (بطاقة مراجع الصيغ)

### TVA Calculation Formulas (صيغ حساب الضريبة)

```
TVA Amount = Price_HT × TVA_Rate

Price_TTC = Price_HT × (1 + TVA_Rate)

Price_HT = Price_TTC / (1 + TVA_Rate)

EXAMPLES:
├── 19%:  TTC = HT × 1.19    |  HT = TTC / 1.19
├── 9%:   TTC = HT × 1.09    |  HT = TTC / 1.09  
└── 0%:   TTC = HT × 1.00    |  HT = TTC (no change)
```

### Confidence Interval Usage (استخدام فترات الثقة)

```
For planning purposes:

CONSERVATIVE PLANNING:  Use Lower Bound (Central - 12-15%)
STANDARD PLANNING:     Use Central Value (Expected)
OPTIMISTIC PLANNING:   Use Upper Bound (Central + 12-15%)

RULE: If Confidence < 75%, always use Conservative or validate manually
```

### Churn Score Components (مكونات درجة الفقدان)

```
Churn_Score = w1×Engagement + w2×Recency + w3×Frequency 
            + w4×Amount + w5×Satisfaction + w6×Competition

Where weights sum to 1.0 and vary by customer segment.

ALERT THRESHOLDS:
├── ≥80%: Critical - Immediate intervention
├── ≥60%: High - Contact within 72 hours
├── ≥40%: Moderate - Weekly monitoring
└── <40%: Low - Standard follow-up
```

